OL,11,     FA young veteran needs Dr Magnus's
OL,12,     Fhelp with a condition affecting
OL,13,     Fhis eyelids. And Dr Natalia
OL,14,     Fstruggles with a lipoma on the
OL,15,     Fjawline of a joker who won't stop
OL,16,     Ftalking.
OL,17,G0000 Killer at the Crime Scene
OL,18,     FAfter a brutally murdered oil rig
OL,19,     Fworker is found in a burnt-out
OL,20,     Fcar, the quiet Scottish town soon
OL,21,     Fbecomes inflamed with rumours and
OL,22,     Ffear.
